## 9. Recommended Fixes

```c
// Fix 1: Get actual file size
struct stat sb;
if (fstat(fd, &sb) < 0) {
    perror("fstat");
    exit(1);
}

// Fix 2: Map only the actual file size
char* rv = mmap(NULL, sb.st_size, PROT_READ | PROT_WRITE, MAP_PRIVATE, fd, 0);

// Fix 3: Bounds check before writing
if (i >= sb.st_size) {
    fprintf(stderr, "Buffer overflow prevented\n");
    exit(1);
}
```
